  "description": "League of Legends audio: the draft (champion select) music on the ban/pick screen, Summoner's Rift's in-game music in matches, the Chinese announcer (first blood, multi-kills, sprees, shutdowns, aces, executions, towers, dragon/Baron, victory/defeat), Rumble's Overheat warning, and all 173 League champions' Chinese lifecycle voices (opening quote, kill, death, respawn; up to three different lines for each kill, death and respawn, said in turn so a champion does not repeat one line all match). The audio is built from your own League of Legends install by build_audio.py. Non-commercial fan project; League of Legends (c) Riot Games.",
